1846
02:02:51.375 --> 02:02:55.000
There was a problem that I was
trying to solve for the past ten years.

1847
02:02:56.750 --> 02:02:58.791
And when I finally solved it,

1848
02:02:59.375 --> 02:03:00.625
I found out that

1849
