1871
02:04:14.416 --> 02:04:16.375
Why are you letting this woman go?

1872
02:04:16.458 --> 02:04:17.625
She is a murderer!

1873
02:04:17.708 --> 02:04:19.333
She is a murderer!

1874
02:04:19.416 --> 02:04:21.375
She is a murderer!

